# Measurement Conventions — Inline Qualified Units

## Imperial Volume
milk = 2 imp pt in ml
beer = 1 imp gal in liters

## Troy Mass (precious metals: 1 troy oz = 31.1035g)
gold = 10 troy oz in grams
silver_bar = 1 troy lb in grams

## US-Qualified (explicit US standard)
us_milk = 1 us gal in liters
us_weight = 1 us oz in grams

## Ton Variants
cargo = 1 short ton in kg
ship = 1 long ton in kg

## Cross-System Conversion
volume_ratio = 1 imp gal in us gal
mass_compare = 1 troy oz in us oz
